---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Vendor pricing — free listings, $40/mo featured | Colorado Elopement Guide"
  description="Every listing is free. Featured placement is $40/month — first month $1 — with click and inquiry reporting and no contract.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 pt-14">
    <p class="eyebrow text-clay-600 mb-3">For Colorado vendors</p>
    <h1 class="display text-4xl md:text-5xl leading-tight">Simple, honest <span class="serif-i">pricing</span></h1>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mt-10">
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-hairline bg-white p-8">
        <p class="eyebrow text-ink/50 mb-2">Listed</p>
        <p class="display text-4xl">$0<span class="text-lg text-ink/40"> / forever</span></p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-ink/75">
          <li>✓ Full listing with your details, ratings and links</li>
          <li>✓ Claim it to edit anytime</li>
          <li>✓ Monthly click &amp; inquiry counts</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/claim" class="inline-block mt-8 rounded-full border border-ink px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-ink hover:text-ivory transition-colors">Claim your listing</a>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-3xl border-2 border-clay-500 bg-white p-8 relative">
        <span class="absolute -top-3.5 left-8 eyebrow bg-clay-500 text-ivory rounded-full px-4 py-1.5">First month $1</span>
        <p class="eyebrow text-clay-600 mb-2">Featured</p>
        <p class="display text-4xl">$40<span class="text-lg text-ink/40"> / month</span></p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-ink/75">
          <li>✓ Top of your category and region pages, labeled "Featured"</li>
          <li>✓ Homepage rotation</li>
          <li>✓ Photo gallery + packages on your listing</li>
          <li>✓ Annual option: 12 months for the price of 10</li>
          <li>✓ Cancel anytime — no contract</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-5 text-xs text-ink/45">For comparison: premium placement on the big national wedding platforms reportedly runs $200–1,200 per month.</p>
        <a href="/claim" class="inline-block mt-6 rounded-full bg-clay-500 text-ivory px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-clay-600 transition-colors">Start with your free listing</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-ink/40 mt-8">Featured placement is always labeled. Placement never changes the Google ratings shown, and we never write or alter reviews.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
